.TH G15FANCTL 1 "2026-07-26" "g15-fanctl 0.1.0" "Dell G15 Fan Control Center"
.SH NAME
g15fanctl \- command-line client for the Dell G15 Fan Control Center
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B g15fanctl
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scriptable diagnostics and control for the
.B g15-fancontrold
daemon, communicating over D-Bus. The
.B detect
subcommand runs standalone hardware detection and does not require the
daemon to be running.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B detect
Print a hardware capability report (coretemp, dell_smm_hwmon, platform_profile, NVML).
.TP
.B status
Print the current sensor snapshot as JSON.
.TP
.B capabilities
Print the daemon's reported hardware capabilities as JSON.
.TP
.BI "set-profile " PROFILE
Set the active thermal profile: \fBquiet\fR, \fBbalanced\fR, \fBperformance\fR, \fBgmode\fR, or \fBcustom\fR.
.TP
.BI "set-fan " CHANNEL " " MODE
Set a fan's mode. \fICHANNEL\fR is \fBcpu\fR or \fBgpu\fR; \fIMODE\fR is \fBauto\fR, \fBmax\fR, or a duty cycle 0\(en255.
.TP
.B list-curves
List saved custom fan curves.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR g15-fancontrold (1),
.BR g15-fanctl-gui (1)
